  "name": "Color of Observation Master",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/third-eye-blue-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your training in Observation Haki has reached complete mastery, allowing you to see a few seconds into the future through a moment of concentration.</p>\n<p><strong>Sense Future.</strong> You cannot be surprised, except when incapacitated by something other than being asleep. If you are asleep when combat begins, you immediately wake up.</p>\n<p>Additionally, at the start of your turn, you can choose to peer a few seconds into the future, expending two Observation Points. Until the start of the next turn, you have advantage on attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws. Additionally, other creatures have disadvantage on attack rolls against the target for the duration.</p>",
